; SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-or-later
;
; DDRAW.DLL import library of the matching build. An import's hint is its
; index in the DLL's sorted export table as the import library records it.
; The original's DirectDrawCreate and DirectDrawEnumerateA carry hints 7 and
; 9, those of DirectX 5's ddraw.dll, whose exports these are; the
; toolchain's older ddraw.lib gives 6 and 8. LIB numbers the exports in this
; order, so the list must stay complete and sorted.
LIBRARY DDRAW.dll
EXPORTS
    AcquireDDThreadLock
    CompleteCreateSysmemSurface
    D3DParseUnknownCommand
    DDGetAttachedSurfaceLcl
    DDInternalLock
    DDInternalUnlock
    DSoundHelp
    DirectDrawCreate
    DirectDrawCreateClipper
    DirectDrawEnumerateA
    DirectDrawEnumerateW
    DllCanUnloadNow PRIVATE
    DllGetClassObject PRIVATE
    GetDDSurfaceLocal
    GetOLEThunkData
    GetSurfaceFromDC
    RegisterSpecialCase
    ReleaseDDThreadLock
